/Title (VP-ddpmpp achieved the highest Inception Score \(5.116\), indicating better image quality and diversity. VP-ddpmpp also had the fastest training time \(~5h 37m\), making it computationally efficient. VE-DDPM trained relatively fast but produced a higher FID, meaning lower realism compared to other models. Overall, different SDE-based models show a tradeoff between training time, image realism \(FID\), and diversity \(IS\).)
